
@startuml

title CityFeedback - Domaenenmodell

enum UserRole {
  CITIZEN
  EMPLOYEE
}

enum ComplaintStatus {
  OPEN
  IN_PROGRESS
  RESOLVED
}

class User {
  - id : String
  - name : String
  - email : String
  - password : String
  - role : UserRole
  --
  + getRole() : UserRole
  + isCitizen() : boolean
  + isEmployee() : boolean
}

class Complaint {
  - id : String
  - citizenId : String
  - title : String
  - description : String
  - category : String
  - status : ComplaintStatus
  - createdAt : LocalDateTime
  --
  + changeStatus(newStatus : ComplaintStatus) : void
  + addComment(comment : Comment) : void
  + resolve() : void
}

class Comment {
  - id : String
  - complaintId : String
  - authorId : String
  - text : String
  - createdAt : LocalDateTime
}

User "1" --> "0..*" Complaint : erstellt
User "1" --> "0..*" Comment : verfasst
Complaint "1" *-- "0..*" Comment : enthaelt

User ..> UserRole : verwendet
Complaint ..> ComplaintStatus : verwendet

note bottom of User
  Nur CITIZEN erstellt Beschwerden.
  Nur EMPLOYEE verfasst Kommentare.
end note

@enduml
